      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@value": "[discoverability_required] The overall sensitivity of THE DATA CARD only. Set based solely on the sensitivity of this data card. not the dataset it describes. See NOTE ON SENSITIVITY above. The sensitivity of the data card and the dataset are independent and will often differ. Uses a controlled vocabulary: - Public: No sensitivity; publicly shareable. - Unclassified_Uncontrolled: Unclassified but uncontrolled; may have minimal sensitivity; generally shareable with minimal controls. - CUI: CUI (Controlled Unclassified Information); requires handling per CUI guidelines; access controls required. - UCNI: UCNI (Unclassified Controlled Nuclear Information); requires handling per UCNI guidelines; strict access controls required. - Classified: Classified information; requires handling per classification level and guide; strict access controls required. - Legacy_Controlled: Legacy controlled information; may have specific handling requirements based on legacy controls; access controls required. - Mixed: Mixed sensitivity; contains a combination of sensitive and non-sensitive information; handling requirements depend on the specific content; access controls required. - Other_Controlled: Other controlled information; may have specific handling requirements based on other controls; access controls required."
      }
    ]
  },
