        "@value": "[reusability_required] Information about the reusability of this dataset, such as license and rights, stewardship, data_quality, integrity, citation and stewardship information. --- License & Rights ---------------------------------------------------- [reusability_if_applicable] Important: Required when release_status = Approved | Published. Use pending if not yet assigned. Includes information about the license governing use of the dataset, as well as any additional legal rights statements. NOTE ON LICENSES AND GOVERNANCE: A public/open license is not always the governing instrument for use, some controlled datasets may not have an SPDX-style reuse license at all, and use may instead be governed by contract, agreement, institutional review, or repository policy."
